cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "如果您在研究中使用了 arXiv 每日电讯，请按以下信息引用。If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "arXiv 每日电讯 (arxivSCI-daily): 多源学术论文个性化订阅与 AI 深度筛选系统"
type: software
authors:
  - name: CHGeronimo
repository-code: "https://github.com/CHGeronimo/arxivSCI-daily"
abstract: "Self-hosted research intelligence daemon: six discovery sources (arXiv categories, Crossref journals, DBLP CCF venues, OpenAlex keyword search, Semantic Scholar authors, citation tracking), a tiered GLM pipeline with user-feedback loop, weekly/monthly trend radar, knowledge graph clustering, and full-text deep reading."
keywords:
  - arxiv
  - paper-recommendation
  - literature-review
  - llm
  - glm
  - flask
  - sqlite
  - research-assistant
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-19"
